abstract: >-
  Registry-grounded measurement of 16,763 MCP tool descriptions. The release contains
  frozen detector outputs, a 150-row purposive human-review frame, full-text
  instance-level adjudication, and a matched source--neutral mocked-harness ablation.
  Detector outputs are candidates rather than verdicts; all support rates are explicitly
  sample-scoped. This citation record is updated with the versioned DOI after Zenodo
  publishes the v1.1.0 archive.
